                    "name": "AbhinavMir"
                },
                "message": "Fix ConstantFolding crash on starred names in assignment targets\n\nvisit_SequenceNode assumed every arg with is_starred set is a\nStarredUnpackingNode with a .target attribute.  Starred names in\nassignment targets (e.g. the loop target of a comprehension) are plain\nnodes marked is_starred by replace_starred_target_node(), so folding a\nsequence that contained one crashed with AttributeError.  Skip such\nargs instead of unpacking them.",
